<title>USA: Goodhue Cty EDA, Minn., won by Norwest.</title>
<headline>Goodhue Cty EDA, Minn., won by Norwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Inv Svcs. said it won $5 million of Goodhue Cty EDA, Minn., courts building lease rental revenue bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
</text>
